    "solution": "Leave the lantern below and reach the stable roof beside the pale pier. Watch the shutter, then climb in the pier’s shade and time the departure so the dark interval covers the fall onto the far tally shelf. The spent pier has now opened the cargo duct. Return below the beam to load the lantern onto the belt, and cross the lower roof to the exit while it reaches its receiver.",
